# Design Token Rules

All visual constants are centralized. Never hardcode pixel values, hex colors, or font sizes in components.

## Layout Dimensions

Import from `src/app/utils/design-tokens.ts`:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
<div style={{ width: 260 }}>

// ✅ GOOD
import { LAYOUT } from "../utils/design-tokens";
<div style={{ width: LAYOUT.VARIATION_SLOT_SIZE }}>
```

Key constants: `LAYOUT.SIDE_PANEL_WIDTH` (400), `LAYOUT.VARIATIONS_PANEL_WIDTH` (340), `LAYOUT.VARIATION_SLOT_SIZE` (260), `LAYOUT.FILMSTRIP_GAP` (16).

## Typography

Use `TYPOGRAPHY` presets from `design-tokens.ts` — do not invent font sizes:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
<h2 style={{ fontSize: 22 }}>

// ✅ GOOD
import { TYPOGRAPHY } from "../utils/design-tokens";
<h2 style={TYPOGRAPHY.cardHeadingMd}>
```

## Color Semantics

Colors encode meaning. Defined as `--bb-*` CSS variables in `src/styles/theme.css`:

| Semantic | CSS variable prefix | Color family |
|----------|-------------------|--------------|
| AI actions/affordances | `--bb-ai-*` | Purple (#a78bfa / #8b5cf6) |
| User actions | `--bb-user-*` | Blue (#60a5fa) |
| Canvas chrome | `--bb-canvas-*` | Gray |
| Frosted panels | `--bb-frosted-*` | Semi-transparent |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded hex breaks semantic meaning
<div className="border-[#a78bfa]">

// ✅ GOOD — uses Tailwind token from theme.css
<div className="border-bb-ai-affordance-border">
```

## Animation Timing

Use `TIMING` constants from `design-tokens.ts` for delays and durations. Do not hardcode `setTimeout` values.
